<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ilex Forest Ahead\nUse the Gate. Don’t Wander.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Tell me somethin’.\rIs it true The Feds\nis back?\rWhat? You beat ’em? Hah!\nQuit cappin’.\rFor real?\nThen let’s see what you got.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: I can’t stand the weak.\rHomies, Hustlers.\nDon’t matter who.\rI hate seein’ ’em hangin’ around.\nThat go for The Feds too.\rThey think they hard as long\nas they in a group.\rBut catch ’em alone, they soft.\nI hate all of ’em.\rStay outta my way.\nYou ain’t special\fif you get in my way.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ain’t nothin’ goin’ on down there. I’m\njust standin’ guard so nobody\fwander in. Outta the goodness of my\nheart.\rAin’t I a good citizen? Please don’t\nlook in the well.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You heard about SlowpokeTail?\nThey say it’s TASTY.\rI ain’t sayin’ I’ve had it. I’m sayin’\nthey say. Allegedly.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The SLOWPOKE been disappearin’\nfrom town...\rWord is somebody sellin’ their tails.\nThat’s how you know the economy bad.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The SLOWPOKE came back!\rKnowin’ them, they ain’t even notice\nthey was gone. That’s the dream.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You here for Kurt’s custom bags? Get\nin line. That old man got a WAITLIST.\fI been on it since May.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cut through Azalea and you in Ilex\nForest.\rBut these skinny trees block the way.\nThe Charcoal Man’s homie can cut ’em.\fHe got a Box Cutter. It’s legal for\ntrees.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWPOKE: ...\r...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Yawn?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Azalea Town\nSlow Livin’ With Slowpokes</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt’s House\rCustom Bags. Real Leather.\nDon’t Ask Where It Came From</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Azalea Town Block\nBoss: Bugsy\fThe Walkin’ Bug Encyclopedia. Nerd.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWPOKE Well\nAlso called the Rainmaker Well.\rLocals think a SLOWPOKE’s\nyawn make it rain.\rRecords say a SLOWPOKE’s yawn\nended a drought 400 years ago.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Charcoal Kiln\rOur FARFETCH’D Fetch Branches\nfor Charcoal! Unpaid.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, who you?\nYou don’t know who we is?\rWe...\nTHE FEDS, BABY!\r...What?\nWe got shut down?\rBruh, who told you that?!\nWe ain’t shut down!\rOkay, we did ONE time.\nBut we BACK to chase\fGiovanni’s dream!\rEnough yappin’.\nShut up and get lost, lil bro!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{SIZE 200}BONK!{SIZE 100}\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We got this old head named Kurt.\nHe’ll handle it. He scary when he mad.\fHe threw his slipper at a cop once.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0564_T23_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I KNEW Kurt had us!\nThat man is 80 and undefeated!</language>
	</row>
</body>
